FDAC joins the rest of the world in global recognition of the second edition of World Food Safety Day on 7th June 2020. In December 2018 the United Nations General Assembly adopted a resolution proclaiming 7th June of every year as World Food Safety Day. This year the event takes place in extremely challenging [\u2026] About NAFDAC NAFDAC Organization Director General NAFDAC Strategic Plan Regulatory Resources Service Charter NAFDAC Vision & Mission NAFDAC Management Working at NAFDAC NAFDAC Programs Compliants & Inquires NAFDAC Quality Policy NAFDAC Advisory Commitees Inside NAFDAC NAFDAC Publications Our Services NAFDAC Governing Council NAFDAC Laws Contact NAFDAC Freedom of Information Frequently Asked Questions Useful Links NATIONAL AGENCY FOR FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION AND CONTROL (NAFDAC) This is the Official Website of Nafdac, the Agency commissioned to protect and promote the public health by instituting an effective and efficient regulatory system that ensures only the right quality food, drugs and other regulated products are manufactured, exported, imported, advertised, distributed, sold, and used Contact us NAFDAC Corporate Headquarters, Plot 2032, Olusegun, Obasanjo Way, Zone 7, Wuse, Abuja, Nigeria Lagos Operation Office: Plot 1, Industrial Estate, Lagos- Oshodi Apapa Express Way, Isolo, Lagos, Nigeria Facebook X-twitter Youtube For enquires 0700-1-NAFDAC (0700-1-623322), reform@nafdac.gov.ng For complaints 0800-1-NAFDAC (0800-1-623322) reforms@nafdac.gov.ng Subscribe to Our Newsletter Email Subscribe Privacy Policy Products We Regulate Drugs Food Chemicals Cosmetics Vaccines, Biologicals, & Medical Devices Veterinary Narcotics Drugs Food Chemicals Cosmetics Vaccines, Biologicals, & Medical Devices Veterinary Narcotics For Industry NAFDAC Guidelines NAFDAC Regulations Tariffs Notes to Industry Micro, Small, & Medium Enterprises (MSME) Bioequivalence NAFDAC Guidelines NAFDAC Regulations Tariffs Notes to Industry Micro, Small, & Medium Enterprises (MSME) Bioequivalence For Consumers Recalls and Safety Alerts Field Safety Alerts Consumer Satisfaction Survey Report Adverse Drug Reactions NAFDAC Electronic Clinical Trial Application Platform Report Substandard/Falsified Medicines Recalls and Safety Alerts Field Safety Alerts Consumer Satisfaction Survey Report Adverse Drug Reactions NAFDAC Electronic Clinical Trial Application Platform Report Substandard/Falsified Medicines About Nafdac NAFDAC Organisation NAFDAC Management Profiles Regulatory Resources Our Services Quality Management System NAFDAC Newsroom Frequently Asked Questions NAFDAC Organisation NAFDAC Management Profiles Regulatory Resources Our Services Quality Management System NAFDAC Newsroom Frequently Asked Questions Useful Links", "content_hash": "aef4254a6482ffcf4ca5412793922bd8fcaa53c7dfad94800632bc5e32040a4b", "domain": "nafdac.gov.ng", "fetched_at": "2026-10-09T05:20:50.905369+00:00", "language": ""}, {"id": "1265", "title": "Annual Reports", "url": "https://www.pencom.gov.ng/2017-annual-report/", "final_url": "https://www.pencom.gov.ng/2017-annual-report/", "text": "Annual Reports Monthly Reports Quarterly Reports Annual Accounts General Publications Pension Reform Act PRA 2014 Resources Downloads PENCOM Seminar & Conferences PENCOM Presentations Speeches Other Related Bodies Site Map Data Protection Data Privacy & Protection Policy Website Privacy Notice ISMS Policy ISMS Policy Document News & Events News Photo Gallery Video Gallery Events Calendar Pension Industry Performance Dashboard Report Employer Pension Contribution Remittance System (PCRS) Contact Us \u00a9 2026 National Pension Commission Annual Reports Home Annual Reports 2017 Annual Report Download > Publications Annual Reports Annual Accounts FAQS General Publications Monthly Reports Quarterly Reports Related Content 2021 ANNUAL REPORT 2020 ANNUAL REPORT 2019, ANNUAL REPORT 2018 Annual Report 2017 Annual Report Maybeach Technologies Limited 174 Ademola Adetokunbo, Wuse 2, Abuja, Nige